{"id":"doug-nuenke","n":"Doug Nuenke","photo":"https://discipleshiplibrary.com/images/headshots/bio_doug_nuenke.jpg","bio":"Doug and Pam Nuenke joined Navigator staff in 1992, serving two years at the University of Kansas. In 1994 they helped launch the EDGE Corps and in 1997 moved to Nav headquarters in Colorado Springs to lead that initiative. In 2004, Doug joined the leadership of the U.S. Metro Mission and served as co-director for three and a half years. Doug now serves as the President and U.S. Director of The Navigators. Doug and Pam have three children.","queue":["17368","17392","17389","17381","17393","17390","17394","17380","17395","17369","16999","17375","17000","17366","17379","17382","17386","17383","17331","17372","17370","17376","17388","17367","17373","17374","17391","16324","17384","17385","17371","17387","17378","17377"],"talks":{"17368":{"t":"Advance of the Gospel In Everyday Life","sp":"doug-nuenke","tp":[],"u":"https://discipleshiplibrary.com/api/media/APP01812.mp3","lk":0},"17392":{"t":"Between the Here and Not Yet","sp":"doug-nuenke","tp":[],"u":"https://discipleshiplibrary.com/api/media/APP01837.mp3","lk":31},"17389":{"t":"Bott Radio Interview","sp":"doug-nuenke","tp":[],"u":"https://discipleshiplibrary.com/api/media/APP01834.mp3","lk":0},"17381":{"t":"Characteristics of His Sheep - Symptoms of Rescued Life","sp":"doug-nuenke","tp":[],"u":"https://discipleshiplibrary.com/api/media/APP01825.mp3","lk":0},"17393":{"t":"Children Before the King","sp":"doug-nuenke","tp":[],"u":"https://discipleshiplibrary.com/api/media/APP01838.mp3","lk":0},"17390":{"t":"Core Value Number One - Know, Love and Become Like Jesus","sp":"doug-nuenke","tp":[],"u":"https://discipleshiplibrary.com/api/media/APP01835.mp3","lk":17},"17394":{"t":"Enduring Bedrock","sp":"doug-nuenke","tp":[],"u":"https://discipleshiplibrary.com/api/media/APP01839.mp3","lk":30},"17380":{"t":"Faith","sp":"doug-nuenke","tp":[],"u":"https://discipleshiplibrary.com/api/media/APP01824.mp3","lk":25